--
--
same_template_signature (the pure-declaration -> definition redirect in
instantiate_template) ignored template-parameter PACK-ness, non-type
parameters' declared types, and only compared function-parameter arity,
so `get<0>(x)` over libc++'s <__fwd/get.h> overload family redirected
the by-index declaration to an UNRELATED same-arity overload's
definition and the instance lost its parameter list ("found no match
for symbol 'get'").  Fixed 2026-08-04 (round 11), [temp.over.link]/6.
